    - Term: MISC_2_BOX_REPLACE_HERO_CONFIRM_2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Bạn có chắc chắn muốn thay thế thuyền viên?
      - Are you sure you want to replace this hero
      - คุณแน่ใจที่จะเปลี่ยนลูกเรือ?
      - 您確定要替換船員？
